hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19211","Affan narrated to us, Hammad ibn Salamah narrated to us from Abu Jafar al-Khatmi from Muhammad ibn Kab al-Qurazi from Kathir ibn al-Saib who said: The two sons of Qurayzah narrated to me that they were presented to the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) at the time of Qurayzah. Whoever among them had reached puberty or whose pubic hair had grown was killed, and whoever had not was spared."
